/ A thumbnail that opens the gallery's lightbox at its photo (see _lightbox), or the photo's own
/ page without JavaScript or in a new tab, so hovering it doesn't prefetch that. The page links
/ back to it by its id.
li.mb-2.break-inside-avoid id=dom_id(artwork)
  = link_to artwork_path(artwork_title(artwork)), aria: { haspopup: "dialog" }, data: { action: "lightbox#open", lightbox_target: "link", turbo_prefetch: false, lightbox_index_param: artwork_counter } do
    = image_tag url_for(artwork.image.variant(:gallery_thumb)), alt: artwork_title(artwork), loading: "lazy", class: "w-full rounded"
